  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Scavenging of the natural U-series radionuclide Th-234 from the water column can be used to assess fluxes of material from the water column. Th-234 profiles were measured at stations in the Laptev Sea to determine particulate organic carbon fluxes in the area.Samples were collected in 2005 as part of the Nansen Basin Observing System (NABOS) program."
